{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "仅隐藏此派生片段，保留完整录音。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hide this derived segment and keep the full recording."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅隐藏此派生片段，保留完整录音。可撤销上次片段编辑。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hide only this derived segment and keep the full recording. You can undo the last segment edit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "内容已更新，等待重新整理": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Content changed. Waiting to reorganize."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "内容片段": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Content segments"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "内容片段已显示在时间轴；完整录音仍可回听。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Content segments appear on the timeline. The full recording remains playable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除片段": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete segment"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除片段？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete segment?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消转写处理": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel transcription processing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "回听片段": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Play segment"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在播放位置拆分": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Split at playback position"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "处理已取消，可重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Processing cancelled. You can retry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "处理状态": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Processing status"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "尚无本机总结，可查看全文或稍后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No local summary yet. Read the transcript or retry later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录音片段": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording segment"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "撤销上次片段编辑": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Undo last segment edit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法完整读取所查询日期的录音片段，请解锁后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unable to completely read segments for the requested date. Unlock and retry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法读取录音片段，请解锁后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unable to read recording segments. Unlock and retry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暂无可显示片段，完整录音仍可回听。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No visible segments. You can still play the full recording."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机总结失败，可重试": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local summary failed. You can retry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机总结已完成": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local summary complete"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机总结已暂停": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local summary paused"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机总结模型暂不可用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local summary model unavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机模型资源未就绪，请在语音转写模型设置中检查。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local model resources are not ready. Check transcription model settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "查看完整录音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "View full recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在本机整理主题与总结": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Organizing topics and summary locally"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在读取完整日期资料": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loading complete date evidence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此片段尚无全文；空转写不表示无人声。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No transcript yet. Empty transcription does not prove there was no speech."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "片段仍在处理中，边界与文字可能更新。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This segment is still processing. Its boundaries and text may change."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "片段删除只隐藏派生内容；完整录音及原始音频仍保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deleting a segment only hides derived content. The full recording and original audio remain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "片段已更新或操作未完成，请刷新后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The segment changed or the action did not finish. Refresh and retry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "片段已更新或移除，请返回时间轴查看。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This segment has changed or was removed. Return to the timeline."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "等待本机处理状态": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waiting for local processing status"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "等待本机总结": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waiting for local summary"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "编辑片段": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edit segment"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "语音转写模型设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription model settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "载入更多全文": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Load more transcript"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "载入更多片段": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Load more segments"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "载入更早的片段": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Load earlier segments"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这会删除本机完整会话、内容片段及全部原始音频。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This deletes the entire local session, its segments and all original audio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "部分原始音频暂不可用，缺口不计为静音。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Some original audio is unavailable. Gaps do not count as silence."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "部分处理失败，可重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Some processing failed. You can retry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重试处理": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retry processing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重试本机总结": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retry local summary"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 生成标题": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Generate AI title"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI でタイトルを生成"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 生成标题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在生成标题…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Generating title…"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "タイトルを生成中…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在生成标题…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "生成录音标题": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Generate recording title"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "録音タイトルを生成"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生成录音标题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将这些转写摘录发送给所选 AI，生成标题？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send these transcript excerpts to your selected AI to generate a title?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選択した AI に文字起こしの抜粋を送信してタイトルを生成しますか？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将这些转写摘录发送给所选 AI，生成标题？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅发送下方开头、中间和结尾摘录，原始音频保留在本机。生成成功后替换当前标题。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the beginning, middle and end excerpts below are sent. Original audio stays on device. A successful result replaces the current title."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下の冒頭・中間・末尾の抜粋のみを送信します。元の音声は端末に残ります。生成に成功すると現在のタイトルを置き換えます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅发送下方开头、中间和结尾摘录，原始音频保留在本机。生成成功后替换当前标题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "确认并生成标题": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Confirm and generate title"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "確認してタイトルを生成"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认并生成标题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "适用于外部 AI 问答、总结与长录音标题。开启免提示后，长录音标题会自动生成；可在「设置 → AI 模型」中恢复确认。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies to external AI questions, summaries and recording titles. With confirmation off, recording titles are generated automatically. Restore confirmation in Settings → AI Models."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外部 AI への質問・要約・録音タイトルに適用します。確認をオフにすると録音タイトルを自動生成します。「設定 → AI モデル」で確認を復元できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于外部 AI 问答、总结与长录音标题。开启免提示后，长录音标题会自动生成；可在「设置 → AI 模型」中恢复确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "即时生效。关闭后，外部 AI 问答与总结直接发送允许使用的文字，长录音转写后自动发送摘录生成标题；可随时重新开启。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Takes effect immediately. When off, external AI questions and summaries send permitted text directly, and recordings automatically send transcript excerpts to generate titles. You can restore confirmation anytime."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すぐに反映されます。オフにすると外部 AI への質問と要約は許可したテキストを直接送信し、録音の文字起こし後には抜粋を自動送信してタイトルを生成します。いつでも確認を復元できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即时生效。关闭后，外部 AI 问答与总结直接发送允许使用的文字，长录音转写后自动发送摘录生成标题；可随时重新开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下次不再提示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Don’t ask again"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "次回から確認しない"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下次不再提示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "适用于外部 AI 问答与总结。可在「设置 → AI 模型」中恢复发送前确认。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies to external AI questions and summaries. Restore confirmation in Settings → AI Models."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外部 AI への質問と要約に適用します。「設定 → AI モデル」で送信前の確認を再び有効にできます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于外部 AI 问答与总结。可在「设置 → AI 模型」中恢复发送前确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发送给外部 AI 前确认": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Confirm before sending to external AI"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外部 AI への送信前に確認"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发送给外部 AI 前确认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "即时生效。关闭后，主动发起的外部 AI 问答与总结将直接发送允许使用的文字；可随时重新开启。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Takes effect immediately. When off, questions and summaries you request send permitted text directly to external AI. You can turn confirmation back on anytime."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すぐに反映されます。オフの場合、自分で依頼した外部 AI への質問と要約は、許可したテキストを直接送信します。いつでも確認を再び有効にできます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即时生效。关闭后，主动发起的外部 AI 问答与总结将直接发送允许使用的文字；可随时重新开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模型配置保存后用于下一次总结与问答。关闭会放弃未保存的模型修改，发送确认偏好即时保存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saved model settings apply to the next summary or question. Closing discards unsaved model edits; the send-confirmation preference saves immediately."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存したモデル設定は次の要約や質問に適用されます。閉じると未保存のモデル変更は破棄されますが、送信確認の設定は即時保存されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型配置保存后用于下一次总结与问答。关闭会放弃未保存的模型修改，发送确认偏好即时保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认在 iPhone 上转写、总结和回答问题。使用外部 AI 时默认先确认发送内容，也可选择下次不再提示。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription, summaries and answers run on iPhone by default. External AI asks you to review the content first, with an option not to ask again."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字起こし・要約・回答は標準で iPhone 内で処理します。外部 AI の利用時は送信内容を確認し、次回から確認しない設定も選べます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认在 iPhone 上转写、总结和回答问题。使用外部 AI 时默认先确认发送内容，也可选择下次不再提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅使用你允许的记录 · 发送给所选外部 AI": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only permitted records · Sent to your selected external AI"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "許可した記録のみ使用 · 選択した外部 AI に送信"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅使用你允许的记录 · 发送给所选外部 AI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这段录音超过 30 分钟，暂不区分说话人，以避免内存不足。音频和全文已保留，可正常查看。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speaker identification is temporarily unavailable for recordings longer than 30 minutes to avoid running out of memory. Your audio and transcript are preserved."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "メモリ不足を防ぐため、30 分を超える録音の話者識別は現在利用できません。音声と全文は保持されています。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这段录音超过 30 分钟，暂不区分说话人，以避免内存不足。音频和全文已保留，可正常查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暂时无法读取音频信息。原文件和全文已保留，请稍后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audio information could not be read. The original file and transcript are preserved. Try again later."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音声情報を読み取れません。元のファイルと全文は保持されています。後でもう一度お試しください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂时无法读取音频信息。原文件和全文已保留，请稍后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 条录音上次传输失败，可重试同步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The last transfer of %lld recording(s) failed. You can retry sync."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 件の録音の前回の転送に失敗しました。同期を再試行できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 条录音上次传输失败，可重试同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 条录音的文件在手表上缺失，请在手表录音列表中检查。重试无法恢复已丢失的文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld recording file(s) are missing on Watch. Check the recording list on Watch. Retrying cannot restore missing files."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 件の録音ファイルが Watch にありません。Watch の録音リストを確認してください。再試行しても失われたファイルは復元できません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 条录音的文件在手表上缺失，请在手表录音列表中检查。重试无法恢复已丢失的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 暂时无法保存录音或同步记录。请解锁手机并检查可用空间，再重试同步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone cannot currently save recordings or sync records. Unlock your phone and check available storage, then retry sync."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone で録音または同期情報を保存できません。ロックを解除して空き容量を確認し、同期を再試行してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 暂时无法保存录音或同步记录。请解锁手机并检查可用空间，再重试同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步服务尚未准备好，请确认手表已配对并安装 WiseLife，然后刷新状态。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync is not ready. Make sure Watch is paired and WiseLife is installed, then refresh status."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同期の準備ができていません。Watch がペアリング済みで WiseLife がインストールされていることを確認し、状態を更新してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步服务尚未准备好，请确认手表已配对并安装 WiseLife，然后刷新状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未能提交重试请求，请稍后重试。手表上的录音仍会保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not submit the retry request. Try again later. Recordings remain on Watch."
